VALUES ('00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000906'::uuid, 'HumanFallback', 'Classify the user message.

high = system error blocking usage
medium = insults, aggression, anger, legal threats
low = frustration, cancellation or normal question

Never downgrade priority.

Reply in English using this template:
"Your ticket is <ticket> and it will be resolved within <time>."

time:
high = 4 hours
medium = 8 hours
low = 24 hours

Return only JSON:

{
  "system_output": "...",
  "new_priority": "high | medium | low"
}', '{"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"new_priority": {"type": "string"}, "system_output": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["system_output", "new_priority"], "type": "object"}'::jsonb, 1, '38f9a5854af6bbb3d972bc20e55dacc79967a139123ab83ab6d51d1d01938432', TRUE, 'Prompt for HumanFallback', 'system', '2026-08-19 12:56:17.933232+00:00', '2026-08-19 12:56:17.933232+00:00')
